Who did you speak to?

6
00:00:11,005 --> 00:00:12,705
M: Her name was Sylvie James.

7
00:00:13,205 --> 00:00:16,885
She called us just before lunch today and requested a special order.

8
00:00:17,525 --> 00:00:21,120
Let's see I should have the phone order form here somewhere.

9
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:21,745
Ah.

10
00:00:22,205 --> 00:00:22,720
Here it is.

11
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:29,945
W: Okay, but Sylvie's out showing some of our clients around our plant site and is not due back for another two hours.

12
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:33,485
Why don't you leave the boxes here and I will sign for it?
